      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö Elisya, “Atera ngölyon nyo mwoghöy ECHOTYON lö, kyoltegho ompö ara Samaria ato teno nyete asïyech kilen sömök cho pö pïsya anta kilen mut nko akonga cho pö matay ompö ropïyon akonga nyo pö silpa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï wowïnay kitigho kegh pöytoghintö chichay pö Tororöt, “Möminye kïgh nyo lata nyoni nyo igho, kïrkegh kölentöy ECHOTYON oropönuno pögh yïm panete!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï Elisya lö, “Isïwïyenyi, wölo melö iyomenyi omisyononi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kötoyö lïko Sirya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimi nyu atoni pich angwanï cho kyamate psenkwet cho kitïpisot kuka kanasyanta Samaria, kïtep kegh chane lö, “Kïtïpisot so yete ntökemeghö? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato kïlecha kïlïtöy kanasyan kïpörecha kömöy, ato kilö tïkwïl ato kïlecha kïtïpisot yete kemeghsocha, kïlenyona kepe kewonyechinö wölo mi lïko pipö Sirya. Nyo ato kesyonchech kesöpchö, ato parecha kewonyö.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona kïnget pïchay nyini le kiwasan akïpa ntökwit möngonay pö lïko pipö Sirya, kïlö kitomtö puryö chi nyonikïny! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo kigh ECHOTYON lïko Sirya kïwir choghïn, kïlïm kighumöto nkaritin nko angoletin cho kiryöwu. Kutam nyu pïchay pö lïko pipö Sirya lö, manan kiwö pöytoghinto Israel kïsom pipö lïko pipö Ititi nko nyo pö pipö Misri kïpka kïporyeghenecha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona kupertoy pïchay pö lïko pipö Sirya nyini le kiwasan akïpïstö emenikwa nko angoletine nko sïkïröyikwa akïpïstö möngengwa lenyini kimi atökïsörï kegh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kitïta pïchay kyamate psenkwet sörömu möngonay, kïlït ema akonga, akwomisyö akïgheghsyö. Atolapay kwip silpa nko koltin nko sïro akïpa kïwïny akïmïlisyö ngat kïlït eme nyo pö odeny. Kïcheng tïkwïn akïpa kïwïny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato mi löt kïmwochinchö lö, “Melö kakighacha kïgh nyo karam. Pö asisï lökoy cho karamach. Amelö, karam kesisyenöcha! Itwecha nyarïl ato kïsisyecha ntökïyech. Kepe nyu lawel kemwochinö wowïntino pöytoghin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpa nyu akïmwochï ripi kukoti kanasyanta Samaria lö, “Kakïpecha möngonay pö lïko pipö Sirya, kelecha kitomtö puryö chi nyonikïny, amelö kikïlïmacha kuti chi, poto angoletine nko sïkïröy cho rötote, akïmi emenikwa le otini kipïstö chane!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmwochï ripichay lökoyechoni wowïntino pöytoghin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnget pöytoghintö oghö akïlenchï mötworichi, “Omwowokwa ye nyu kïgh nyo kenan lïko pipö Sirya atökwigh! Nkït chane lö kyamecha kömöy nyoman, nka nyoni köpïstö möngengwa akïpa kïghïpcheghö wölo le wuw. Nonöy chane lö töptoy kïpïstocha kanasyantenyo akepa keyarata omisyö, atökïpka chane kïnamecha kesöpchone akïlït kanasyante.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö mötworintenyi anka, “Keyontena pich kïpegha angoletin mut ompö chete tökïsöpchote, ompö kanasyan, atökenkïtunö lö ne kitö nyo kegha karkegh pïchï söpchot nko söpïch pö pipö Israel chay kewonyö.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona kïyonta pöytoghintonay pich odeny cho kipegho angoletin atökïpa kuros lïkonay pö pipö Sirya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïrïp pïchay ntökwit lalwa Yordan, akwotini kipetöy, kïnyorchï arawet sïro nko karïn cho kilasta pipö Sirya otini kimi kïryoghöy. Kïmïlisyö pïchay kikïyonta akïpa kïmwochï pöytoghin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpa pipö Samaria kïcheng tïkwïn cho kimi möngonay pö Sirya. Kïlenyona kikyaltegha pïsya kilen sömök anta kilen mut nko akonga cho pö matay ropïyon akonga nyo pö silpa, le ato kimwa ECHOTYON!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutö pöytoghinto Israel wowïn pö lïk nyo kitigho kegh kïrip kuka kanasyan. Kïtyakatyak pich nyinte ompö kukanoni ntökïma le ato kökimwa Elisya otini kiwö pöytoghintö kïtuyö nko nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kökimwochï Elisya pöytoghin lö, kyoltegho ompö ara Samaria ato teno nyete asïyech kilen sömök cho pö pïsya anta kilen mut nko akonga cho pö matay ropïyon akonga nyo pö silpa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akiyokyï wowïn lö, “Möminye kïgh nyo lata nyoni nyo igho, kïrkegh kölentöy ECHOTYON oropönuno pögh yïm panete!” Kuyokyï Elisya lö, “Isïwïyenyi wölo melö iyomenyi omisyononi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kighisyö lenyoni ngalechoni, ompöwölo kikïtïka nyinte otini le kumat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kamïla korka nyo pö Syunem korengwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
